        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sandy Fox, Mike Judge, Greg Daniels\n- Works: King of the Hill\n- Roles: voice actress, singer, dancer, creators\n- Topics: American animation, anime, video games, television sitcoms\n\nFacts:\n- Sandra Marie Fox was born on July 13, 1963.\n- Sandy Fox is an American voice actress, singer, and dancer.\n- Sandy Fox has had numerous roles in animated cartoons, anime, and video games.\n- Mike Judge and Greg Daniels created King of the Hill.\n- King of the Hill is an American animated sitcom.\n- King of the Hill aired on Fox from January 12, 1997 to September 13, 2009.",
